        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ American Eagle 3101 ADA Compliant Light Commercial Door Closers</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe American Eagle 3101 Series is a rack and pinion closer featuring a cast aluminum body with a round style arm assembly. Hydraulic control is achieved through separate non-critical sweep, latch and backcheck valve adjustments.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>American Eagle 3101 Series ADA door closers are non-handed, and tri-packed for regular, top jamb and parallel arm applications.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Package complete with fasteners for wood, fiberglass (composite materials) or metal doors and frames. Sex nuts and bolts are also furnished standard. Common 9-1/6\"\u001d x 3/4\"\u001d mounting hole pattern.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3101 is listed by U.L./U.L.C., complies with UL 10C and UBC 7-2 (1997) for positive pressure and is certified to ANSI A156.4 Grade 1.\r\n</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\"></p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications and Features:</b> PDQ American Eagle 3101 ADA Compliant Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Back Check</li>\r\n<li>Cast Aluminum Alloy Shell</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/6\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 243 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 44\" interior / 36\" exterior</li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li>Grade 1 (Highest Grade)</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved, UL US Listed 63Z0</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable from 1-4</li>\r\n<li>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Optional Hold Open and Door Saver Arms</li> -->\r\n<li>5 Year Manufacture Warranty</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-3100.pdf?v=1704262223\" target=\"new\"><b>PDQ 3101 Install Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Full line of <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=American Eagle 3100\"><b>Door Closer Accessories for PDQ American Eagle 3101</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\"\r\ncellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"3\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">Optional  Arms for 3101\r\nDoor Closer</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"200\" height=\"24\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999002\">Friction Hold Open Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"200\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-door-saver-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999005\">Heavy Duty Door Saver Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"200\">\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999016\">Heavy Duty Hold Open Arm</a>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/friction-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999002\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319002_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\"></a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-door-saver-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999005\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319005_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\"></a>\r\n<br>Parallel Arm Mount Only\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-hold-open-arm-for-american-eagle-3100-pdq-999016\"> <img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AE-319016_195.gif\" border=\"0\" width=\"195\" height=\"218\"></a>\r\n<br>Parallel Arm Mount Only\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n</p>\r\n -->\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>",
